{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29046","headline":"游钱塘青山李隐居西斋 · 许浑","name":"游钱塘青山李隐居西斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小隐西亭爲客开，翠萝深处遍苍苔。\n林间扫石安棊局，岩下分泉递酒盃。\n兰叶露光秋月上，芦花风起夜潮来。\n云山遶屋犹嫌浅，欲棹渔舟近钓台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29046.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29046","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}